{
  "_meta": {
    "doc": "Ascension 功能开关说明见 README.md「Ascension 开关」与 kimi_advice/ascension_implementation_todo.md",
    "rollback": "将对应项 enabled 设为 false 即可禁用子系统，无需改 JS"
  },
  "ascension": {
